{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1530,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50cfa031dda380f60d55295f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc2b0db28278f979f108f6e626eeaf8ff4553286870fbc94ddfa52a96348396a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f80374745873cb6e5a888a7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次一定要赢给所有人看！绝对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d38a85d4cc915173bb3b20e3a4d6e33ee239d7b3405ca96c49062a05355d24f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45da9144019553f836bb86d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要更加更加强大，绽放光芒给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d93daa45677bb51e0a84fac32978d092c4cb5675627644587a95544a2dc3a56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df2b4347d7ae205d452b72e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这不是终点…因为我还没有放弃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1d8791cb58f3cb5a8ecf115d12843c9daac3d961c7ec549704e4723942895b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e121d01fb2e907d1fdd386cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多少次我都会重新站起来…不管多少次…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6de809865cf25f27109dd8fb86162032bebc6f66b98fd0e8107645248d77f425",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af7b46a161e3c6f074351d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "杏目，绝不会输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a1c592bdcc035331497013820317955718eadfc645a69000a53acdcd8c9c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01976cbf12981538b7bf89bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么是我这双手抓不住的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f679e2d7680fa986b33d4999693a7fcec310bea1cccdd930950053dffc947dcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b69c1287151ca900fe9c4c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61abca981c523b9c5cf0cba11ab77d05cecc5f37ba5ebe56c1bd23c831c6e46a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b829139f4075e4529ef425",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会输的，我可是杏目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2cf477ccdd95316a8e17f4cf9f8f2790c65af8cf960dd8ded80bc32399101f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad020b4043a1c189dc277364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好耀眼……不过，我也\r\n绝不打算输给夏日的烈日。\r\n防晒霜的准备可是万无一失的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e83f7f8e29c066f36176c3b59470d9e2b7228f088abf3cc1fe7c12434086361d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd777ead3c1f378980555134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～～～！居然什么都没做！！\r\n这么怠惰的夏天，有生以来还是第一次呢。\r\n――好啦，从明天开始加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "91efd11175ab72b26636edd62ee006ef9ff21d1d354d66f84564833383b92446",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ccb4058dd40c9769199183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢下去，赢下去，一直赢下去…\n将谁都不曾见过的辉煌\n握在这双手里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5afcb616ca8ebedc117ff08dc2c2842c546800684659f61b19679fe0407d8541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f642102bcdbbf3b6baf941a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕……天空小姐居然还在向我\r\n炫耀她在钓鱼大赛赢了的事……！\r\n明年，我绝对会赢得胜利的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21439ee053b6e9ab6695f68a6af1dd5775389308dabb7908ce63f791de1add5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a67be37220f1087eceeefa1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现方面我也有自己的讲究。好好看着吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc63a3e24f87363d3902f905621ee2312c63ebafb7250a0f2b4aafd45471c7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3452a49de9eb86707f5dc2eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摄像机的位置是这里，那里，还有…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c2261755f004da06e388b8384a9c2cb927169fedb686cf23fa870014399f3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954af63bd1ea6948697038af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为想赢所以要赢。仅此而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e18eec1d92174ac2c35d9193785077b923a5e57ed3a58fba30f80b744439de4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c41a646a71e12de2d7e30ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要再来一次并跑？我用\n这双腿，你用那时候的摩托。\n无论到哪里都一路破风而行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3622a4ce8883dfe7127da4bc7e13cb3231c83e43bd73164d9ae43d24a00c6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944c13e7b9bee30bca1f0d9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学习方面我有自信哦。哪门课都是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c979c2fd0c348f25270dd5cad69e422150a19dc07a52f411397634a2c98d34c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96a2e1eb04ed68fd6e2ac9a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比谁穿得都好看，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c274430947832c60ca9108e6838553a5d2ea07929a925f77d1679898cf35dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e2603e604c9f736184ccdd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在世界哪个角落，这条蝴蝶结就是标志哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbfd97752cfe3c21749f8a4aa71b6fcef2ae2a1d0dfeb5793be3bbd006e2208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53189b0d212de1e7a29d2bbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢这蹄铁的设计。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34045cdb07068673eaf96dabaab78dc0f2500b112e6544367a4eb6837a53bbf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ddf4fa25ef131584993f39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体我觉得算是相当柔韧的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40a92795caf7ffc8ec28ef940048b3247d08686c4fe17645991206191fedf2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d47ea00f509dbba3dc4f3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑色是点睛之笔。有了它就能收紧视觉对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "792089fdba06827ddd28614f68000dca1044b3ae0632614782c39337d2a6cfe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8941a70c583e07e20b82cac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺码和穿着感都挺好的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fc2dbede25bd7f20e9e027fd245fdb0702723f762738d4d9df8bc5b1fa2e5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16637b3c1d9d2d8830f1efab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这件我也喜欢上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9d3dab64a91180c039e624206d873a76813ccec8573715b68d09bc18dc1a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f4d57323fee96ecd61d3beb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "购物经常是防爆装束约我去的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4ba07f29345b211559f210243387f105a59d8362849b5244ec9a8f8f2ed687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19557058186afe564905bb5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我稍微做了美甲哦。注意到了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2a00c4f4fe6aebeda914f6c9e49af2c27f635be14f8cb68f081120884d61b43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e60fd4de62a3612d0545746f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学习方面我有自信哦。哪门课都是。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c979c2fd0c348f25270dd5cad69e422150a19dc07a52f411397634a2c98d34c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c1d4863f71eb64e2c059f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比谁穿得都好看，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c274430947832c60ca9108e6838553a5d2ea07929a925f77d1679898cf35dec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bda4800a8c5fee0baca32cb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在世界哪个角落，这条蝴蝶结就是标志哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbfd97752cfe3c21749f8a4aa71b6fcef2ae2a1d0dfeb5793be3bbd006e2208",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c227bd60d816fc100b748480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢这蹄铁的设计。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34045cdb07068673eaf96dabaab78dc0f2500b112e6544367a4eb6837a53bbf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f227ad1fb04934f7fce73e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体我觉得算是相当柔韧的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40a92795caf7ffc8ec28ef940048b3247d08686c4fe17645991206191fedf2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b98db3e0dcbb0c47cacfe797",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑色是点睛之笔。有了它就能收紧视觉对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "792089fdba06827ddd28614f68000dca1044b3ae0632614782c39337d2a6cfe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec65946c6bf323ad4f98a6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺码和穿着感都挺好的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0fc2dbede25bd7f20e9e027fd245fdb0702723f762738d4d9df8bc5b1fa2e5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43d7c657fc3313923a46cc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这件我也喜欢上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9d3dab64a91180c039e624206d873a76813ccec8573715b68d09bc18dc1a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d5f08cdeedf44308ec84099",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d63a5ff1ef283e54835ff20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早起一分，强一分。\n既然如此，选项只有一个。\n你也是这样想的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f80b7134f48ffe0b8f0d4cac2506594c98913d587fe7a08bbf0d7ade0520a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd4672a3c6d9e1651605797e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一天的开始从整理床铺\n做起。把床单整理得一丝不皱，\n我的早晨才算开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b274a71e65e4a70907e2015553528d34edc14947167383eceb0447d0fa71078e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:613d1653fb07263aa63d94f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐是我自己做的，注重控制\n卡路里和PFC平衡。比赛当然要\n以最佳体型去挑战嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "748e46e394da226cf35ff56d8dd9a78794c65f32102ad1b647744435042f8394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d35d7211b2aef4474ad2c00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白天的拉伸非常重要哦。\n来，你也摆个柔韧的姿势！\n后背，要我帮你压一压吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fb795df6f99dc29d31dc9065c6c58d121481fe0efb217d2e27f61cf986f6d3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2aace259ed5a054e35d1f096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想久泡个澡，但过度的话\n对健康不好。正因如此，\n每一天的入浴时间都要过得充实哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb0034e1e3e310688820db2912f3e9d0040f14a3ac7683324ea8ca832a9910e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a538385240d09ef31507f64c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的反省点全写完了。\n接下来只要超越它就好！\n从现在起就已经在期待明天了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8785ffbb5c35038c82fa5875777681bcfbd7c63f59adcbf3a653001d125a476e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7b0c322988b918e8075f74e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢在樱花下比赛。\n赢完之后再看樱花，\n会显得更美对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f933fa9669d7743539e7c24fc951810979cba47d0b0befe7cd232959daaff40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0de13d746997e585494a73d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "炎炎夏日里的冷水澡，绝了…！\n还有黄瓜。就靠这两样，\n夏天也能轻松度过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "93383a4c3e321517b4540c47f067ed63d947be14ee32786616a07020eeb62f03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b72db8fbc92c132870c0de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "读书也好运动也好艺术也好…\n什么都要不留遗憾地享受！\n一点时间都不能浪费！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a18126e0e792d3a6ddd8760f468bee743c496de8bb279a9e958c5d962b7e19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b515a2874c80ab5e3c78456",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被子盖太多了，被防爆装束\n说像千层酥一样！\n…不着凉才是最重要的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "38acf210094db793f7eaf74b15c79e7b2553b6ec843958eacede43905740a907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab510a22c1001ce62999507",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b864b7841af89022e20379f78c16aa3ac36fd63bcfd3cb24ab6d04b749dcdc58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33f334ad64f9c93780cd716",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "潘多拉同学，对我做的手工便当\n特别喜爱呢。明明感觉她吃过的\n华丽料理比这多多了，真不可思议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e8b5ca4fd84ba02eca4db6fc556587c21a6dab4b43569467f72ec434bab3716",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab608194821e6a3fe5e39df7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和紫丁去吃了御好烧，\n那孩子翻面真的超厉害…\n托她的福，最近天天都在吃御好烧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a98f5c11ea72f77119c5de8e8f4ddd824fea4f6ccdfe872df9fb8de1af27ffd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bdb3fbc15afe5cb7b8178c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和防爆装束去买衣服，大概都会\n被当成换装人偶…不过多亏\n如此，能遇到很漂亮的衣服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b637a8be414573d976747e124f038bb2985fe254fce3eb2ec0500702d7fbde40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6683cd491e68555990e7347",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要跟神业学画漫画哦。\n首先…从能画出\n漂亮的圆开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eae65db10f8f220855b4600c0ed23f304624a8d2c051e37cefdebb7bd62f356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5f7b7bf8030006b550e3cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迪拜拥有世界上最多的纪录。\n所以我很想去看看…也跟\n强击聊过计划了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "feb56307c15a38942bbbfacb8748b6117f8af02498839ee645397385fe2c4b87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:173344dcfdddbf6980a6fdf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前，我见过没有观众的\n舞台。所以正因如此，要把有\n大家同在的舞台变成最棒的演台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c63385c831d8b5ce6aa309e88d94e35a093871b7050a3cbc6e5b3c17de8eb7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6188ac9089b94559c15f5a6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小谋勇，对很大的响声也完全\n不为所动！在黑暗的摄影棚里也一样哦？\n…内心，我也得更淬炼才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94f6bf5551c550c6888806b62b2ac57d8aec47c407e0a47863f3e28663d86f3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f296d103db65f3f359b63ea7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到水蓝色，就一定会\n想起我的比赛…与这颜色一起，\n我要展现出那样鲜明的活跃！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5f2f652101a774e7bd912b6bac1c7a0dee88834e22f88617cdcf7e49682528c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce6d704ff10b00f76cc7f7e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛前我会摸一下项圈。\n无论怎样的舞台还是比赛，\n比谁都耀眼…带着这份决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "594c42587332308643acf283372b0a8e0c9e3fdf61ebb25ebf3bb5703e0d3b62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:932276b525eab6e42e1e0062",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上起来后，要把今天一天\n该做的事情写成便条哦！\n从小时候起就一直在坚持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b01d27b54d80c026380dd9ae76d6e069db9bc5a5ea997c0fdc9999c2333a36bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c924e8afb995476801bf2ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要和潘多拉同学开茶会，\n结果全是我喜欢的点心！\n明明她自己喜欢的也可以呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09e990bf3d2f77ecf00cab289025d934e813b2db79688ea3ac0bd26806dc9b49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:586184b3b401187461743ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜负？好啊。\n我可没打算输，\n做好觉悟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9e60e51ec4bce1ede9de05e02cfad5bfd357a8cdc17ed8611e1fa74a8928e9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ef0a8ac28035a2488d33a38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了睡好觉，和防爆装束各种\n尝试着呢。白开水…还有香薰什么的！\n是睡前的乐趣哦。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc3a102ade25ad99f0599962137debb1a00e00133343c9fd8c17f3f4c420ff4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61af86bbade1228babe58998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新来的孩子们，\n个个都充满了干劲呢。\n呵呵，我也不能输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b716056bebbaae101dc302136d79ecb719d51072761c83fcf700bec90e483f49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b29766e0e47e7e7ce9d5c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体质上，我对中暑格外\n警惕。所以…别光顾着\n看我，你也要注意身体哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c91bba9a8d84b396c06f4e84b5ba304f4c905ec09ff2cff252647a35ac64978",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34b463b83a7eff37f87cfac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学问之秋呢。大家都要学习的话…\n我就要学得更多。好期待\n下次考试呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00acc3f659cc186340747ef21bd8d4c8d88fadac1b2a05b5f144bc90c88a22dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a41fd7c2c6999b8e60e908b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天冷的话出门也会变\n懒对吧？…正因如此，\n我现在才要去训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5780cc1549f53e08c5d24d9fc05408f0b147e12febe315f9448724b39c39d48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abf2a71c81bc0fde7644ed0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一项训练是什么呢？\n决定了就告诉我。\n在那之前我先继续跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "443ba2718c73470ebcf6c377c4460a785f84eefa77ac35b16415a32cdcaf859c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f13d7958c6fae8ed474c8750",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要变得比谁都强！然后…\n赢下去，赢下去，一直赢下去，\n缔造新的传说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2023ee48a0e134d8e2ded9c04d8c9e2c2e056894b16315d96ba9afbb2f64576d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b23a0643a3187ee1c15da11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "体温调节已经做好万全准备了！\n所以不用那么担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ed6269c6bcfc6ec89337fef2d63d979adbc33ef2f62281fae67bfdcb1c9e3ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2811cc91edeb98eabf98a45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要提高一下训练强度？\n当然不会胡来的。\n…等等，是真的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a781e25c8a88d03c54b6f1b91541cf67bd941a776069ad8003cde32faf34311c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6172d5d8bad82fd8afb87d35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论发生什么事，我绝没有\n受挫的打算！…因为\n那对迄今为止的我太失礼了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff31c884b6951c06e7ec50e992a0fe4dea52fa32148f0ae8d4f01a966d17ee7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec19c37ddba9a4009c30a8ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也真是个不服输的人呢…。\n呵呵。不过这才\n是我的训练员呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5f06f3366d7f5c588398ecbbd874214508a2d262e6be79f12f13e2d3ca0858c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:129cd4dc67bdda7475b0d5e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你的话，即使是谁都未曾\n见过的伟业也能达成…\n没错，我也相信着呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c780e5bc7c2e52bc5c0df7f4000e0ea5d7bec2774f5f1895e0c79bb38a57c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3656c75bb22fa08f5158f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉天空比平时更辽阔…\n呵呵，世界真是广阔呢。\n没时间缩在小天地里了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "357f40022154fb53b7adb5641d877504f4234d90c83eff6bce271208f7b85b5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f0c5602dde28f24e08935b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为是你，才能创造出这个时代呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81f0a2f45637b919ed8564975db904d1a54bd0a9cd7847dd75147f9e8718f950",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d8f0d172493379b8146aa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谁都不曾见过的景象，创造出来了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89ccd05ffa37591aa5007b936cf594149f9cfb30c68169588d5b045cf825611f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d4ae793657baa3ac65693b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可没有输给任何人的打算！",
      "source_fingerprint": "348a131cc68b97462cf19368ba089c28a60b341d7002c8306353cb58e7645550",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d12df7709000c263f56bc37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有任何极限！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eba30537db75b3c82638a218e2dc9c3fb23a02c2ee3f46152062f2f809622e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c978a9ea10d2b2f635f022bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "杏目！准备好赢了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "874b06fb19149230516061f1504b4750843c522a1e08a8838ab29ebe8285337c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a5a37eca500171c3c19a77b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传说也好神话也好，用这双腿打破。\n新的时代由我来创造！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0a44166f8d4077cbae7fcf26fdde004b16458949b0710769039eb392a56bae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a8c578ace6036c25394f7e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次想让我教你什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8dc2533c09f7eed183fb376e2b5a2306bb32e7c3a148d23a23dbbdf3a49059b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:016b994423a6c3f211838eee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，很可靠对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcfcbf516b043c0181761ce690e562829a99cdfc8873f1f504ce7991e6d53753",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "95006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
